    narr:narration """On 2026-07-20 this region records a single architectural decision: the analytics pipeline migrates from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, targeting [Q3 2026](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_4). The decision is carried by [Dave's direct declaration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_1) — a single speech move bundling the switch with two expected gains — and then restated across three [editorial](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_2) [bullets](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_3) that decompose the quote into its parts: the [migration itself](narr:AnalyticsDatabaseMigration), the [10x performance claim](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_3), and the timeline. All children are supports; none challenge or qualify. The thematic span is narrow — one infrastructure change, one rationale (performance plus cost), one date. Nothing here addresses application architecture, data modeling, API design, or non-analytics systems.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#AnalyticsDatabaseMigration> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_4> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline. 10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Database migration**: PostgreSQL → QuantumDB" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Performance gain**: 10x analytical queries" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Dave frames the move as bold innovation (openness-to-change, self-enhancement); the timeline bullet quietly carries a conservation register — the same decision read as prudent scheduling rather than adventurous leap." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1784542513573_4> ] ;
